    <title>124 ｜那些年我为睡个好觉作出的努力（有用版！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6ac7344ee742e36efcbfad88</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6ac7344ee742e36efcbfad88</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 08 Oct 2026 21:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>最近开始换季，求职迫在眉睫，一堆事情压着身上，失眠和早醒逐渐变多。这期和大家聊聊「为了睡个好觉，哪些办法真的有用」？希望咱们硕博生都能无痛拥有一百分的睡眠。</span></p><p><span>Timeline：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a> 睡眠空间和用品</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="490">08:10</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 床上不看手机</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 泡沫轴按摩和呼吸训练</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a> 运动时间和进食、补剂</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="980">16:20</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a> 昼夜节律和灯光</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1100">18:20</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a> 中医穴位按压</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1280">21:20</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a> 泡脚和翻白眼</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1400">23:20</a>–<a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 声音和饮食</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1580">26:20</a> 收尾</span></p><p><span>感谢收听！希望所有收听本期博客的朋友们都能拥有好睡眠～</span></p><p></p>]]></description>
