    <guid isPermaLink="false">69bff5892d318777c92b7a51</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Mar 2026 14:26:50 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一年四季总有一刻会因痘痘而困扰，但是长了这么多年来，或许还没好好系统的了解过这个“朋友”。这一期大葱结合了她近半年的战痘史，好好和大家梳理了她在这方面做的功课和心得体会，可谓是结合各家言论和自家经历，结合中西医诊断，结合辛酸苦辣。欢迎大家在评论区留下你和痘痘的故事～或者你的战痘经验。</span></p><span></span><p><span>TimeLine:</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="224">03:44</a> 战痘准备：关于痘痘形成的原因</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span>判断生长时期</span></li><span>  </span><li><span>判断痘痘类型    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="374">06:14</a> 粉刺</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="692">11:32</a> 炎性痘痘</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1199">19:59</a> 脓包结节囊肿型</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span>  </span><li><span>分析痘痘生长的部位    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1572">26:12</a> 额头、眉间、脸颊</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1838">30:38</a> 鼻子两侧、下颌线</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1896">31:36</a> 战痘前奏！追本溯源</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2077">34:37</a> 复盘自己的生活习惯，知己知彼百战不殆！</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2362">39:22</a> 除了自省，也可以借助一些外界的检查了解原因</span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2641">44:01</a> 战痘开始！如何消灭各种痘痘</span></p><span></span><ul><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2663">44:23</a> 通用性的措施</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2782">46:22</a> 针对粉刺该咋办？</span></li><span>  </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2843">47:23</a> 针对炎性痘痘该咋办？    </span><ul><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3005">50:05</a> 忌口很重要！</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3063">51:03</a> 规律三餐</span></li><span>      </span><li><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3120">52:00</a> 睡子午觉</span></li><span>    </span></ul><span>  </span></li><span></span></ul><span></span><p><span>希望这一期对正在战痘的朋友们有所帮助！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎联系我们：</span></p><span></span><p><span>微博：@之乎择野</span></p><span></span><p><span>小红书：邵邵，@邵邵（id: 1180411044）；大葱，@Dacong1020 （PS：小红书找到我们会更快哦）</span></p><span></span><p><span>给我们写邮件：Zhihuzeye_letter@yeah.net</span></p><span></span><p><span>加入听友群进行更酣畅的聊天请加vx：dacong-1020</span></p><span></span><p><span>再次感谢收听「之乎择野」，希望我们为你提供了一些自由、积极、向上的能量，希望我们都可以更接近自己的内心，自去自来，自由自在！ &nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
